{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/315","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/315/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/315/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/315/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/315","id":6025106405,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFVR088AAAABZx_T5Q","number":315,"title":"[消息队列 MQ07] 消息积压：加了十台消费者，为什么还越排越长？","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:41:03Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- message-queue-series:2026-10-25:mq07 -->\n\n**核心顺序7/9；MQ07仅作稳定题库索引。待定稿，未开拍。** 拟为独立视频及配套图文，无观看硬前置。\n\n## 独立问题与主线\n\n消息持续进入，消费者也一直工作，队列为什么仍在增长？增加实例为什么可能不增加处理能力？\n\n1. 本片自行建立流入、业务完成与待处理量；用一段明确标为示例的流量，从已有积压起，用相同时段的流入量和完成量更新待处理量（不小于零），说明缓冲不是额外算力。\n2. 固定Kafka传统消费组的两个分区与两个已工作的实例，增加十个实例，直接显示新增实例没有可分配分区，完成速率没有因此提高。\n3. 沿真正处理路径定位受限环节；在前提明确的对照中改善实际瓶颈或降低流入，令完成速率超过流入，展示历史积压如何排空。\n\n观众应能先比较流入与完成，再判断并行度或下游资源是否限制吞吐，而非把“扩消费者”当作通用答案。本片不展开参数调优、批量、压缩或重试死信方案。\n\n## 专项对照验收\n\n同一输入流分别运行扩实例前后两支，核对分区分配、活跃实例、完成数与积压曲线；改善瓶颈后保留相同统计口径，验证只有净排空速度为正时积压才下降。不能将已拉取到客户端的消息当成业务已经完成。\n\n## 边界与资料\n\n分区数限制仅针对所选传统consumer group，不套用于Share Groups。增加分区涉及Key映射与顺序变化；数据库已饱和时更多并发也可能无效或更差。区分日志lag、在途消息和业务完成延迟，位点距离不直接等于等待秒数；示例速率不是Kafka性能测量或容量承诺。\n\n- [Kafka 4.4 Design](https://kafka.apache.org/44/design/design/)：传统消费组分区分工。\n- [Kafka 4.4 Basic Operations](https://kafka.apache.org/44/operations/basic-kafka-operations/)：消费组分配、空闲实例与lag观察。\n\n公共制作与验收规范统一见[总览#308](https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/308)。本片自带速率与分区前提，图文可补诊断指标，避免把多个调优机制塞入短片。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/315/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.g